#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:8
msgid ""
"Embeddable frontend content packs register via **manifest / desktop / "
"mobile** exports."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:10
msgid ""
"The unified settings window is aggregated by the registry in [`src/frontend/"
"shell-ui/`](../../src/frontend/shell-ui/); contract in [`src/frontend/shell-"
"ui/lib/settings.ts`](../../src/frontend/shell-ui/lib/settings.ts) (unrelated "
"to SAP)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manifest (required)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:14
msgid "Path: `./manifest` — JSON-serializable metadata."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field             | Description                                          |\n"
"| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | Application id                                       |\n"
"| `displayName`     | Display name                                         |\n"
"| `version`         | Version (usually synced with monorepo root package)  |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | Supports desktop embed                               |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | Supports mobile embed                                |\n"
"| `sap`             | Optional; true satellite metadata (`relay`, `tools`) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:25
msgid ""
"Implementation SSOT: [`src/frontend/shell-sdk/manifest.ts`](../../src/"
"frontend/shell-sdk/manifest.ts)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop / Mobile profile"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:30
msgid ""
"`./desktop` — desktop shell compile-time import profile (window spec, launch "
"mode)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:30
msgid ""
"`./mobile` — mobile profile; when unsupported, `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "`embedMode`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Value              | Represents                       | Sidecar required?                  |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | companion (VRM + tools)          | **Yes** (embedded in same process) |\n"
"| `bundled-spa`      | shell-ui module (chat, admin, …) | **No**                             |\n"
"| `unsupported`      | mobile profile placeholder       | —                                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:40
msgid ""
"`embedMode` describes **how the shell hosts the UI**, not which Hub wire the "
"module uses at runtime (that is determined by module code: Hub RPC vs REST)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:42
msgid "Bundled SPA: Hub provides `/api` and `/hub/rpc/v1`."
msgstr ""

