#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current frontend packages"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package                          | appId       | embedMode (profile) |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-companion` | `companion` | `embedded-sidecar`  |\n"
"| `@freeanima/feature-chat`        | `chat`      | `bundled-spa`       |\n"
"| `@freeanima/feature-console`     | `console`   | `bundled-spa`       |\n"
msgstr ""

